From 8f4a6d0e5b6c4a1d9e3f2b7c6a5d4e3f2b1a0c9d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Schaka <jonastanzer@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] offload: fix missing OffloadAPI dependency on PluginCommon

PluginCommon's sources (PluginInterface.cpp etc.) include the generated
OffloadAPI.h, but PluginCommon's own add_dependencies() list only names
intrinsics_gen and PluginErrcodes -- not the OffloadAPI custom target
(offload/liboffload/API/CMakeLists.txt) that actually generates that
header. With no build-order edge between them, ninja is free to schedule
PluginCommon's compiles before OffloadAPI's tablegen+copy steps, so any
plugin linking PluginCommon (confirmed here via omptarget.rtl.amdgpu)
can fail with "OffloadAPI.h: file not found" -- reproduced against this
repo's TheRock pin (release/therock-7.14, amd-llvm @ 46fcb339) at real
parallel ninja builds (-j2 and -j6 nested), traced down to this exact
missing edge by reading offload/plugins-nextgen/common/CMakeLists.txt
and offload/liboffload/API/CMakeLists.txt directly, not guessed from the
symptom alone. Not gfx803-specific -- this is generic amd-llvm/offload
build-graph code, reproducible on any target architecture built through
this same pin, and already fixed upstream.

Already fixed upstream at llvm/llvm-project@319a50123c63 ("[Offload] Fix
missing dependency on generated OffloadAPI headers", #198055, landed
2026-05-16) but not yet merged into ROCm's amd-staging fork as of this
pin's date (2026-06-20) -- the merge that picked it up landed 2026-07-04,
two weeks after this pin. Ported here rather than switching THEROCK_REF
to a newer branch/commit: this repo's vendored rocm-libraries/rocm-systems
patches were verified against release/therock-7.14's specific submodule
pins, and floating THEROCK_REF to main previously required a real re-port
of those patches (see therock-experimental/README.md's "Re-porting across
pins" section) -- not worth reopening for an unrelated one-line fix that's
already merged upstream and will arrive naturally once this branch's pin
next advances.
---
 offload/plugins-nextgen/common/CMakeLists.txt | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/offload/plugins-nextgen/common/CMakeLists.txt b/offload/plugins-nextgen/common/CMakeLists.txt
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/offload/plugins-nextgen/common/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/offload/plugins-nextgen/common/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -28,7 +28,7 @@ add_library(PluginCommon OBJECT
   src/GenericProfiler.cpp
   ${emissary_sources}
 )
-add_dependencies(PluginCommon intrinsics_gen PluginErrcodes)
+add_dependencies(PluginCommon intrinsics_gen PluginErrcodes OffloadAPI)

 # Only enable JIT for those targets that LLVM can support.
 set(supported_jit_targets AMDGPU NVPTX)
--
2.55.0
